      "core_premise": "People deserve good care today and the chance to live longer, healthier lives. This chapter considers aging research, fair access to treatments shown to be safe and effective, reproductive freedom, and how longer lives could change families and society. People retain the freedom to make lawful, informed choices about life extension and dying, with dignified care.",
